      "writtenOn": "2021-11-15T17:23:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a difference between cros and zephyr error codes. Zephyr uses negative error codes, and cros uses positive. I\u0027ve used it to tell apart the values from error codes, but I\u0027ve later added the correct error codes in ioex_drv and didn\u0027t change this. Done.\n\nAlso the ioex_get_port can\u0027t be implemented, because it operates not on signal, but on port, where... using the zephyr\u0027s drivers, there won\u0027t be ioex id, nor port.\nThe ioex_get_port is used only on servo_v4p1, so it isn\u0027t important function.",
